# Storefront typography (file-scoped)

When editing customer UI under `yasvik-monsoon-tales`:

- Display: `font-cormorant` + `font-semibold` + `text-deep-forest`
- Body/UI: `font-inter` (DM Sans)
- Layout: import `retailClasses` from `@/brand/retailTheme` (`container`, `titleLg`, `body`, buttons)
- No Syne / Inter / light display headings / arbitrary page max-widths

See also the always-on rule `yasvik-storefront-typography.mdc`.
